sequenceDiagram
    autonumber


    box rgb(238,248,242) GUI thread
        participant B as Capture button
        participant C as CaptureController
        participant W as Window<br/>(wiring)
        participant V as ImageViewerWidget
        participant X as CaptureStatusPresenter
    end
    box rgb(244,245,255) Snapshot thread
        participant Q as SnapshotWorker
    end

    B->>C: requestSnapshot()
    C-->>W: snapshotRequested
    Note over C,W: connected by the window
    W->>V: displayFrame()

    alt no frame displayed yet
        W->>C: saveSnapshot(empty image)
        C-->>X: snapshotError(no frame available)
    else a frame is displayed
        W->>W: draw the contour layers on a copy
        W->>C: saveSnapshot(image)
        alt the queue is full
            C-->>X: snapshotError(queue is full)
        else the image is queued
            C->>Q: enqueue(image, preferences)
            Note right of Q: bounded queue, protected by a mutex.<br/>Each request carries its own copy of the<br/>preferences, taken when it is queued
            Q->>Q: build the file name and save the image
            alt saved
                Q-->>C: snapshotSaved(file name)
            else write failed
                Q-->>C: snapshotError(file name)
            end
            C-->>X: the result is forwarded
        end
    end
    X->>X: show the result to the user
